        },
        {
          "text": "Futhi futhi ngokuhlakanipha kwakhe uyokwenza ubuciko obusesandleni sakhe buphumelele; futhi iyozikhulisa enhliziyweni yayo futhi ibhubhise abaningi ngokuthula; kodwa uyakwaphulwa kungengasandla.",
